WEBVTT

00:01:25.931 --> 00:01:30.122
and the deforestation
of nearly half the historic mangrove cover

00:01:30.146 --> 00:01:32.013
in South and Southeast Asia.

00:01:32.615 --> 00:01:34.179
Mangroves, on the other hand,

00:01:34.203 --> 00:01:36.980
are much more than just habitat
to the fishing cat.

00:01:37.379 --> 00:01:40.641
They are home to a fantastic
array of species,

00:01:40.665 --> 00:01:42.458
like jackals,

00:01:42.482 --> 00:01:44.022
turtles,

00:01:44.046 --> 00:01:45.752
shorebirds

00:01:45.776 --> 00:01:47.760
and otters.

00:01:47.784 --> 00:01:48.886
(Laughter)

00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:51.830
Mangroves also prevent soil erosion,

00:01:51.854 --> 00:01:57.037
and they can be the first line of defense
between storm surges, tsunamis

00:01:57.061 --> 00:02:00.315
and the millions of people
who live next to these forests